%Amd.DeviceDesc% = Sof_Device, PCI\VEN_1022&DEV_1502
%Amd.DeviceDesc% = Sof_Device, PCI\VEN_1022&DEV_15E4
%Amd.DeviceDesc% = Sof_Device, PCI\VEN_1022&DEV_15E3
